{"active_object_question_id": "q_1", "active_object_ref": {"object_id": "q_1", "object_type": "question_set", "source_turn_id": "turn_1780702123263_4ac0847e9f", "version": 1}, "answer_authority_source": "deep_question_generation", "assistant_content_source": "", "capability": "deep_question", "conversation_id": "tb_77794d73f43549828a29deda", "correct_answer_present": false, "entry_surface": "near_real_http_ws_intent_context_probe", "event_count": 144, "event_source": "deep_question", "execution_engine": "", "execution_path": "deep_question_generation", "is_correct": "", "learner_answer": "", "missing_trace_fields": [], "official_answer": "", "options_hash": "", "question_hash": "6c8c52a8b3096ff26bff3ec5ae039c3ac789847d36697d0da71e82429b8e5a9d", "question_id": "q_1", "question_lifecycle_decision": {}, "response_excerpt": "### 第 1 题\n\n某压型金属板屋面，设计未注明坡度要求，其最小坡度应为多少？\n- A. 3%\n- B. 5%\n- C. 8%\n- D. 10%\n\n### 第 2 题\n\n压型金属板屋面，当设计未明确坡度要求时，其最小坡度值应为多少？\n- A. 5%\n- B. 10%\n- C. 15%\n- D. 20%", "result_mode": "custom", "result_seq": 143, "round_id": "QA30-INTENT-007", "session_active_object_ref": {"object_id": "q_1", "object_type": "question_set", "source_turn_id": "turn_1780702123263_4ac0847e9f", "version": 1}, "terminal_status": "completed", "trace_complete": true, "trace_expectation": "active_question_followup_or_grading", "turn_id": "turn_1780702123263_4ac0847e9f", "turn_semantic_decision": {"allowed_patch": ["set_active_object"], "confidence": 0.86, "next_action": "route_to_generation", "reason": "用户明确要求出选择题/练题，应生成新题而不是批改当前 active question。", "relation_to_active_object": "continue_same_learning_flow", "target_object_ref": {"object_id": "historical:cf366dd4c395fffa", "object_type": "single_question"}}, "turn_status": "completed"}
{"active_object_question_id": "", "active_object_ref": {}, "answer_authority_source": "tutorbot_kb_first_fast_policy", "assistant_content_source": "", "capability": "tutorbot", "conversation_id": "tb_66693ec9b00840b484ada912", "correct_answer_present": false, "entry_surface": "near_real_http_ws_intent_context_probe", "event_count": 133, "event_source": "tutorbot", "execution_engine": "tutorbot_runtime", "execution_path": "tutorbot_kb_first_fast_policy", "is_correct": "", "learner_answer": "", "missing_trace_fields": [], "official_answer": "", "options_hash": "", "question_hash": "", "question_id": "", "question_lifecycle_decision": {"business_gate_result": "no_candidate", "decision_source": "none", "exact_question_blocked_reason": "", "llm_scene_candidate": null, "needs_clarification": false, "reason": "no deterministic scene and LLM proposal not applicable", "required_anchor_status": "", "scene": null, "scene_confidence": 0.0, "selected_skill_names": []}, "response_excerpt": "## 结论\n\n按现行政策（2026年未发布报名条件改革新政），一级建造师报考条件为：**取得工程类或工程经济类大学专科学历，工作满6年，其中从事建设工程项目施工管理工作满4年**（本科满4年/3年，硕士满2年，博士满1年）。\n\n## 注意\n\n2026年是否已实施新版报考条件（如降低工作年限或放开专业限制），目前我手上的证据不足以确认最新政策变化。建议你登录 **中国人事考试网（www.cpta.com.cn）** 查看当年报考文件，以官方通知为准。", "result_mode": "tutorbot_kb_first_fast_policy", "result_seq": 131, "round_id": "QA30-INTENT-008", "session_active_object_ref": {"object_id": "tb_66693ec9b00840b484ada912", "object_type": "open_chat_topic", "source_turn_id": "turn_1780702149294_05f59b5934", "version": 1}, "terminal_status": "completed", "trace_complete": true, "trace_expectation": "open_world_teaching", "turn_id": "turn_1780702149294_05f59b5934", "turn_semantic_decision": {}, "turn_status": "completed"}
